 source tools as well as those from Microsoft and Qualcomm Technologies, Inc.","thumb_url":"https://developer.qualcomm.com/sites/all/themes/at_qdn_branded/images/qc_developer_network.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"Qualcomm Developer Network","service_icon":"https://developer.qualcomm.com/sites/default/files/favicon.png","thumb_width":200,"thumb_height":215,"from_url":"https://developer.qualcomm.com/hardware/windows-on-snapdragon/developer-resources","original_url":"https://developer.qualcomm.com/hardware/windows-on-snapdragon/developer-resources"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Pdd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5aa015b6-6aa8-45b9-ab0b-7399717b20ef","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"そうなるとあとはWindowsなんだけども…遊べるモノが出てこない。","ts":"1635408007.362600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ftG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9c43f167-6a9b-4003-aac2-bdb4229953c8","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"そこはあんま重要じゃないんですよね。実際使う上でLinux動くことが前提になってるので。組み込みを除けば。\n\n組み込みは逆にSoCが決まるのでそこに合わせちゃえば良い。","ts":"1635407847.361800","thread_ts":"1635407299.360300","subtype":"thread_broadcast","reactions":[{"name":"naruho","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"222"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"e3db8002-6b65-434a-893c-d65819c091b2","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"ARM、現状SoCの数だけブート方法あるみたいでそれ何とかなれば置き換え加速しないかなーと思っていたりもする","ts":"1635407299.360300","thread_ts":"1635407299.360300","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jx/f"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"b8ed4d4b-c5d6-4226-8b5f-4c302613b361","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"\u003chttps://pc.watch.impress.co.jp/docs/topic/review/1361592.html\u003e\n後日レビューか","ts":"1635407746.361600","attachments":[{"fallback":"PC Watch: 【レビュー】 Alder Lakeこと第12世代Coreが編集部に着弾！早速開封してみる","id":1,"title":"【レビュー】 Alder Lakeこと第12世代Coreが編集部に着弾！早速開封してみる","title_link":"https://pc.watch.impress.co.jp/docs/topic/review/1361592.html","text":"　Intelから、次世代デスクトップ向けCPU「Alder Lake」のレビュアーズキットが到着した。後日公開予定のレビューに先だって、レビュアーズキットを開封した際の様子を写真で紹介しよう。","image_url":"https://pc.watch.impress.co.jp/img/pcw/list/1361/592/i14.jpg","blocks":null,"ts":1635350400,"service_name":"PC Watch","service_icon":"https://pc.watch.impress.co.jp/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://pc.watch.impress.co.jp/docs/topic/review/1361592.html","original_url":"https://pc.watch.impress.co.jp/docs/topic/review/1361592.html"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ahhA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"94c3f305-a51f-4a9b-aaf9-ec1aeb4dd44a","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"まあ、メーカーCPUごとに別バイナリというほどじゃない状態にはなってるのかな?\nただ、コンパイルできれば、というのはOSから各種パッケージ全部だから、なかなか大変だよねえ(ある程度揃ってはいるからいいんだけど)","ts":"1635407654.361400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IGh0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e3db8002-6b65-434a-893c-d65819c091b2","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"ARM、現状SoCの数だけブート方法あるみたいでそれ何とかなれば置き換え加速しないかなーと思っていたりもする","ts":"1635407299.360300","thread_ts":"1635407299.360300","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jx/f"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3396222c-4e2a-4bba-96fc-fc9e3ec76196","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"自分でソフトウェアコンパイルできるならx86である必要ないですよね","ts":"1635407190.359000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6gE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1a316d3f-9f67-496c-ad83-b5012041fba3","type":"message","user":"U8CC7MDCL","text":"Graviton2ほんとコスパ優秀。\n絶対x86じゃないといけないとかじゃない限り選択肢としてありあり","ts":"1635406866.358300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich